<title>SPAIN: Sevillana says to pay 28 ptas gross interim div.</title>
<headline>Sevillana says to pay 28 ptas gross interim div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Sevillana de Electricidad said on Tuesday it will pay an interim dividend of 28 pesetas gross per share against 1996 results, effective January 2 1997.</p>
<p>This is a 14.3 percent increase on the 1995 interim dividend, the firm said in a press statement.</p>
<p>The net dividend is 21 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
